# A church's own guide wording. Contains staff names and the channel layout,
# so it stays on their machine: never committed, never served by Pages.
# The committed docs/data/*.json are the generic example.
docs/data/*.local.json

# A church's own diagrams, for the same reason: a real channel-layout or
# camera-chain drawing names the room and the gear in it. The committed
# docs/img/*.svg are generic. A *.local.json can point at img/local/....
docs/img/local/
